# Send only what the image needs. .local holds the database, backups, browser
# profiles and secrets; only its wheels may reach the Docker daemon.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!.local/wheels/*.whl
!manage.py
!Generic Chart of Accounts.csv
!pacioli/
!migrations/
!scripts/
!extensions/
!ofx/build/bin/pacioli-ofx
**/__pycache__
